{"5147670":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Rolling Fortress","steam_appid":5147670,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5148620],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FORTRESS NEVER STOPS<\/h2><br>Humanity's last landship is rolling into enemy territory. Command the Rolling Fortress across ten hostile sectors, from the Ashland Frontier to the Omega Core, and survive escalating waves of armor, aircraft, missiles, and sector bosses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AIM THE BIG GUN<\/h2><br>Your automated batteries handle the firing line, but the fortress's high-energy cutting laser is yours to command. Aim with mouse, keyboard, or touch controls to slice through incoming rockets, heavy bombs, gunships, and armored columns before they reach your shields.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR WAR MACHINE<\/h2><br>Recover scrap from destroyed enemies and refit between waves. Improve the rotary point-defense autogun, heavy siege cannon, guided missile pod, cutting laser, shields, and hull. Build tactical card combinations for cryo strikes, orbital lances, overcharges, decoy flares, emergency repairs, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEN SECTORS. TEN COLOSSAL BOSSES.<\/h2><br>Every battlefield has its own atmosphere, enemy pressure, doctrine, and final war machine. Adapt your loadout as faster projectiles, denser air swarms, heavier armor, and apocalyptic bosses push the fortress to its limit.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tactical side-scrolling defense with direct laser aiming<br><\/li><li>Automated point defense, artillery, and missile systems<br><\/li><li>23 upgrades, tactical cards, and battlefield powerups<br><\/li><li>10 distinct sectors with escalating wave compositions<br><\/li><li>10 unique sector bosses<br><\/li><li>Persistent sector unlocks, scores, and five-star mastery<br><\/li><li>Mouse, keyboard, and touch input support<br><\/li><li>Original soundtrack and cinematic military sci-fi presentation<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FORTRESS NEVER STOPS<\/h2><br>Humanity's last landship is rolling into enemy territory. Command the Rolling Fortress across ten hostile sectors, from the Ashland Frontier to the Omega Core, and survive escalating waves of armor, aircraft, missiles, and sector bosses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AIM THE BIG GUN<\/h2><br>Your automated batteries handle the firing line, but the fortress's high-energy cutting laser is yours to command. Aim with mouse, keyboard, or touch controls to slice through incoming rockets, heavy bombs, gunships, and armored columns before they reach your shields.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR WAR MACHINE<\/h2><br>Recover scrap from destroyed enemies and refit between waves. Improve the rotary point-defense autogun, heavy siege cannon, guided missile pod, cutting laser, shields, and hull. Build tactical card combinations for cryo strikes, orbital lances, overcharges, decoy flares, emergency repairs, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEN SECTORS. TEN COLOSSAL BOSSES.<\/h2><br>Every battlefield has its own atmosphere, enemy pressure, doctrine, and final war machine. Adapt your loadout as faster projectiles, denser air swarms, heavier armor, and apocalyptic bosses push the fortress to its limit.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tactical side-scrolling defense with direct laser aiming<br><\/li><li>Automated point defense, artillery, and missile systems<br><\/li><li>23 upgrades, tactical cards, and battlefield powerups<br><\/li><li>10 distinct sectors with escalating wave compositions<br><\/li><li>10 unique sector bosses<br><\/li><li>Persistent sector unlocks, scores, and five-star mastery<br><\/li><li>Mouse, keyboard, and touch input support<br><\/li><li>Original soundtrack and cinematic military sci-fi presentation<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Command a colossal mobile fortress through a 10-sector post-apocalyptic campaign. Aim its cutting laser, manage automated heavy weapons, intercept enemy salvos, salvage scrap, and build a devastating arsenal between escalating waves.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5147670\/e163605000700ecc9fc0e1f0e875887a5936f568\/header.jpg?t=1793714431","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5147670\/cfc28113fea8ac5176aff8345039822c14738bbe\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793714431","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5147670\/cfc28113fea8ac5176aff8345039822c14738bbe\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793714431","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Last Exit Diner"],"publishers":["Last Exit Diner"],"demos":[{"appid":5148620,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":449,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$4.49"},"packages":[1782502],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Rolling Fortress","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"